  "label": "Antisemitic Concept: Puppet Master",
  "description": "This is an antisemitic trope that portrays Jewish people as manipulative 'puppet masters' who control global events and governments. This concept is used to dehumanize Jewish people and justify their persecution by portraying them as dangerous, controlling figures who must be removed from power. The meme's text implies this by suggesting that Jewish people are 'pretending to be white' and are therefore a threat to the world.",
